# {{.Name}} ({{.Type}})

Manages a Morpheus load balancer profile. Profiles define application-layer behaviour (HTTP, Fast TCP, Fast UDP), session persistence (cookie, source IP, generic), or SSL/TLS settings (client SSL, server SSL) for NSX-T load balancers.

Each profile has a `service_type` that determines which `config_*` block to use. Only one config block may be set per profile.

